diff --git a/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md b/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
index b9a29ea..975a0f8 100644
--- a/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
+++ b/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
@@ -1,5 +1,13 @@
 # Архитектура Task Tracker
 
+Single-task producer source retains one task UUID through all roles, with
+scheduler-only terminal acceptance/reconciliation and ordinary assignment-scoped
+agent proposals. SDLC project access always requires active local ownership or
+explicit membership; global human hints do not expand the SDLC directory. New
+queue/reserve is project-opt-in after original-operation replay. Tracker adds no
+runtime scheduler or Hermes proof protocol; parent integrates existing routes.
+[Integration boundary and remaining resume blocker](TRACKER_SINGLE_TASK_HANDOFF.md).
+
 Reserved PM producer commands use Tracker reservation/lease recheck and atomic
 command/history write. No Fleet admission HTTP call is made on the producer
 path. [PM producer lease](PM_NATIVE_ADMISSION.md).
diff --git a/docs/DATA_MODEL.md b/docs/DATA_MODEL.md
index 7757fb5..6b1067d 100644
--- a/docs/DATA_MODEL.md
+++ b/docs/DATA_MODEL.md
@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 # Дата-модель Task Tracker
 
+Single-task lifecycle stores canonical stage/status in `sdlc_tasks.state`; its
+delivery head stores execution only. Explicit many-to-one stage/status mapping
+uses three dedicated issue status IDs, preserving legacy board statuses/history.
+Immutable assignments, proposals, results, reconciliation and operations share
+one transactional projection/outbox boundary. Optional canonical PM status and
+Draft submode are omitted on historical rows without them. Parent owns migration
+registration/order for the additive SQL fragment.
+[Schema and wire details](TRACKER_SINGLE_TASK_HANDOFF.md).
+
 Additive 000091 adds immutable `sdlc_pm_native_admissions`, keyed by execution/run
 and tied to assignment version, fence and exact owner observation. Additive
 000092 adds transaction-scoped `sdlc_pm_state_write_permits`; a reserved task's
diff --git a/docs/TRACKER_SINGLE_TASK_HANDOFF.md b/docs/TRACKER_SINGLE_TASK_HANDOFF.md
index 4a0b416..d1edd42 100644
--- a/docs/TRACKER_SINGLE_TASK_HANDOFF.md
+++ b/docs/TRACKER_SINGLE_TASK_HANDOFF.md
@@ -110,23 +110,28 @@ SdlcService::pm_feedback_operation(task, actor, key)
     -> Result<PmFeedbackReceipt, AppError>;
 ```
 
-These are internal methods, not a requirement to expose the internal tagged
-command as a new public protocol. Parent should adapt the existing reservation,
-heartbeat, terminal and operation-readback family in its existing controller.
